<title>UK: Premium Underwriting says may get bid.</title>
<headline>Premium Underwriting says may get bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premium Underwriting Plc said on Thursday it had received approaches from different companies that may lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>As a result, the company said it decided to postpone the placing of one million new ordinary shares at a proposed price of 140p per share until the position can be clarified.</p>
<p>The trust's shares were marked up 1.0p at 141p by 1240 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
